      "fit": 0.91
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "After spreading misinformation for profit, an aggressor faced the consequences of their illegal activity. The law enforcement agency, acting as enforcers of justice, moved to restore order with an arrest warrant, leading to the detention of the subject. This outcome highlights the professional impact and reputational damage averted for the wronged public figure, whose career had been disrupted by the initial false claims.",
